        <locale name="packages.panel.category.systemcheck.checksum.popupText">
            <en><![CDATA[
            <p>Here you will find a list of all the files that this package contains.
            If files have been changed and these changes do not come from you,
            you should check the package. The checksum test is based on the local file system.</p>
            <p>Legend:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>OK - The checksums match.</li>
                <li>Unknown - No checksum file.</li>
                <li>Modified - Local or online version of the file is not the same as the one on the local file system.</li>
                <li>Missing - The file is not within the original package and it was created on your filesystem.</li>
                <li>Additional - The original package contains this file, but it was not found on your local filesystem.</li>
            </ul>
            ]]></en>
